<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-030" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:wine" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:wine:m0000" ref="385_7fd_092">石崇</persName>每要客燕集，常令美人行酒，客飲酒不盡者，使黃門交斬美人。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:wine:m0030" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">王丞相</persName>與<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:wine:m0034" ref="39o_b6y_n74">大將軍</persName>嘗共詣<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:wine:m0040" ref="385_7fd_092">崇</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:wine:m0042" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">丞相</persName>素不能飲，輒自勉彊，至於沉醉。每至<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:wine:m0061" ref="39o_b6y_n74">大將軍</persName>，固不飲，以觀其變。已斬三人，顏色如故，尚不肯飲。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:wine:m0089" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">丞相</persName>讓之，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:wine:m0094" ref="39o_b6y_n74">大將軍</persName>曰：「自殺伊家人，何預卿事！」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:flute" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:flute:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">丞相</persName>素為諸父所重，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:flute:m0009" ref="e09_16c_498">王君夫</persName>問<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:flute:m0013" ref="39o_b6y_n74">王敦</persName>：『聞君從弟佳人，又解音律，欲一作妓，可與共來。』遂往。吹笛人有小忘，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:flute:m0050" ref="e09_16c_498">君夫</persName>聞，使黃門階下打殺之，顏色不變。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:flute:m0068" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">丞相</persName>還，曰：『恐此君處世，當有如此事。』</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:kaizi" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:kaizi:m0000" ref="e09_16c_498">王愷</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:kaizi:m0003" ref="e09_16c_498">君夫</persName>，東海人，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:kaizi:m0010" ref="j7j_veb_l8w">王肅</persName>子也。</p>
</text>
